       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TARIBAPO.
       AUTHOR.        B FONAGY.

      ************************************************************
      **                                                        **
      **                  T A R I B A P O                       **
      **               ---------------------                    **
      **                                                        **
      **   THIS PROGRAM IS THE MAIN PROGRAM FOR LOADING         **
      **   AND VALIDATING PURCHASE ORDER INFORMATION BEING      **
      **   SENT DOWN TO CSIS FROM ARIBA BUYER. THIS INFORMATION **
      **   IS SENT DOWN USING SEVERAL DIFFERENT RECORD TYPES:   **
      **                                                        **
      **      TYPE 1 = HEADER DATA (NEW PO)                     **
      **           2 = LINE DATA   (NEW PO)                     **
      **           3 = HEADER DATA (CHG PO)                     **
      **           4 = LINE DATA   (CHG PO)                     **
      **           5 = HEADER DATA (CHG PO - CANCEL)            **
      **   DCR08   6 = ITEM DESC   (NEW PO & PO CHG)            **
      **                                                        **
      **   ADD NEW PO'S                                         **
      **   RECORD TYPE 1 & 2:                                   **
      **   ------------------                                   **
      **                                                        **
      **   THE NEW PURCHASE ORDER INFORMATION CAN ORIGINATE     **
      **   FROM A REQUISITION THAT WAS FIRST SENT UP TO ARIBA   **
      **   BUYER FROM CSIS -OR- WAS CREATED IN ARIBA BUYER.     **
      **   THIS PROGRAM WILL PROCESS ANY PO'S BEING SENT DOWN   **
      **   FROM ARIBA BUYER. IT WILL LINK THE HEADER AND ITEMS  **
      **   TOGETHER BASED ON THE ARIBA PO NUMBER. ONCE ALL      **
      **   RELATED RECORDS ARE FOUND, THE HEADER RECORD IS THEN **
      **   VALIDATED. WHEN THE HEADER IS VALIDATED, THE ITEMS   **
      **   ARE PASSED VIA AN ARRAY TO CARIBITM FOR VALIDATION.  **
      **   IF CARIBITM RETURNS ALL OF THE ITEMS AS VALID THEN   **
      **   IT WILL THEN CALL "CGENARIB" TO GENERATE A NEW CSIS  **
      **   PO NUMBER. ALL RELATED PO FILES  ARE UPDATED WITH    **
      **   THE NEW PO DATA AND A SUCCESSFUL RESULT IS LOGGED    **
      **   IN FILE MCFPARRSLT TO BE PASSED BACK TO ARIBA BUYER. **
      **                                                        **
      **   CHANGE\CANCEL PO'S                                   **
      **   RECORD TYPE 3, 4, 5 & 6:                             **
      **   -----------------------                              **
      **                                                        **
      **   CHANGES CAN OCCUR IN ARIBA BUYER TO EXISTING PO'S    **
      **   AND ARE SENT DOWN TO CSIS AS FOLLOWS:                **
      **                                                        **
      **       1) RECORD TYPE 3 = HEADER DATA CHANGE            **
      **          CHANGES LIMITED TO FIELDS:                    **
      **          @@ FREIGHT TERMS                              **
      **          @@ FOB                                        **
      **                                                        **
      **       2) RECORD TYPE 4 = LINE ITEM CHANGE              **
      **          CHANGES LIMITED TO FOLLOWING FLDS:            **
      **          @@ ACCT'G DATA                                **
      **          @@ PRICE                                      **
      **          @@ QTY                                        **
      **          @@ ITM DESCRIPTION                            **
      **          @@ ITM UOM                                    **
      **          @@ PRC UOM                                    **
      **          @@ TAX CODE                                   **
      **          SEE LINE ITEM EDIT RULES IN PGM CARIBITM      **
      **                                                        **
      ** DCR08 3) RECORD TYPE 6 = LINE ITEM DESCRIPTION CHG     **
      **          CHANGES LIMITED TO FOLLOWING FLDS:            **
      ** DCR08    @@ ITM DESCRIPTION (MULTIPLE LINES)           **
      **                                                        **
      **                                                        **
      **   ARIBA BUYER CAN ALSO CANCEL AN EXISTING PO           **
      **                                                        **
      **       3) RECORD TYPE 5 = CANCELS THE ENTIRE PO BY      **
      **          CALLING PGM SCOMPPO TO ZERO OUT ALL           **
      **          REMAINING ON ORDER QUANTITIES.  THE ENTIRE    **
      **          PO IS SENT DOWN BUT ONLY THE HEADER RECORD    **
      **          IS PROCESSED.                                 **
      **                                                        **
      **--------------------------------------------------------**
      ** MISC NOTES:                                            **
      **                                                        **
      ** @ INPUT RECORDS ARE SEQUENCED BY ARIBA BUYER PO NUMBER **
      **   AND DESCENDING RECORD TYPE. THIS PLACES THE HEADER   **
      **   RECORD LAST FOR DATA ACCOUNTABILITY PURPOSES.        **
      **                                                        **
      ** @ THE ENTIRE PO IS SENT DOWN WHEN A CHANGE OCCURS BUT  **
      **   ONLY RECORDS WHERE THE 2ND POSITION OF THE REC-IND   **
      **   FIELD = "C" ARE ACTUALLY PROCESSED FOR CHANGED DATA. **
      **   ALL OTHER RECORDS JUST "TAG ALONG FOR THE RIDE"      **
      **                                                        **
      **--------------------------------------------------------**
      **                                                        **
      **   PROGRAMS CALLED:    CARIBITM   CARIBDEL   SPOTRACK   **
      **                       SEDIVNCK   STC360     SPOMSTRM   **
      **                       SCURCONV   SVENPRC    CPORMVUSR  **
      **                       CGENARIB   SREQLINK   SVENITM    **
      **                       SCOMPPO    GETDTSTMP2 CPOLOG     **
      **                       CMPLTINFO  CPOFOBWDW  CPOVIAWDW  **
      **                       SCALCBGT   SMODBDGT   GETJOBACL  **
      **                       CVALID(COMMENTED OUT)            **
      **                                                        **
      *****************************************************************
      **                MODIFICATION   HISTORY
      *****************************************************************
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      **    WHO       WHEN     WHAT (DESCRIPTION)
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      ** D.RAUCH   12/16/2002  FILLED DPORECD FAX/PRINT DATE WITH
      **   DCR01               CURRENT DATE(YMD) PER DAVE PLUM
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      ** D.RAUCH   06/19/2003  ADD CODE FOR CHANGE/CANCEL PROCESS.
      **   DCR02  DCR03        SEE CARIBITM FOR LINE ITEM EDITS.
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      ** B. FONAGY 10/21/2003  IF ARIBAPO-INVOICELESS-IND = 'Y'
      **                       CHANGED TO 'X'
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      ** D. RAUCH  12/16/2003  RECORD LOCK OCCURS IN SMODBDGT WHILE
      ** DCR04                 ATTEMPTING TO CANCEL A PO. MADE CHANGE
      **                       TO CC200-CANCEL-PO TO RETRIEVE DPORECD
      **                       USING NO LOCK OPTION.
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      ** D. RAUCH  01/07/2004  MOVE REQUISITION EDIT AND PO LINK'G
      ** DCR05                 TO ITEM LEVEL PROCESS. ADDED REQ# TO
      **                       TRAILING FILLER OF COPY MBR ARIBAPOITM
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      ** D. RAUCH  03/18/2004  CHECK FOR SAP VENDOR NBR AND CONVERT IT
      ** DCR06                 TO CSIS 10 CHAR FMT
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      ** D. RAUCH  05/27/2004  ADDED CODE TO UPDATE BUDGET AMT DURING
      ** DCR07                 LINE ITEM QTY OR PRICE CHANGE
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      ** D. RAUCH  07/07/2004  ADDED CODE TO PROCESS EXTENDED ITEM DESC
      ** DCR08                 RECORD TYPE "6"
      ** --------- ----------  ----------------------------------------
      ************************************************************
